            <ArticleTitle>Heterotaxy syndrome with azygous continuation-causing pseudo Budd-Chiari syndrome after cardiopulmonary bypass.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1890-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Heterotaxy syndrome with interruption of the inferior vena cava and direct hepatic vein inflow into the right atrium has important implications for cardiac surgery. We report a case causing pseudo Budd-Chiari syndrome after cardiopulmonary bypass.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
